<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 8.5 points to 793.5 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 8.5 points to 793.5 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 8.5 points on Wednesday to 793.5, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the energy index losing the most, down 25.7 points, or 2.70 percent, to 925.2 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
